From: Wenbo Ji <36562829+fusheng-ji@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:21:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional row-packed BSR products (GH-2069)

Allow medium-length CUDA rows to share a thread block. Keep the option explicit because the benefit depends on matrix structure, and preserve the existing automatic dispatch.

Signed-off-by: Wenbo Ji <36562829+fusheng-ji@users.noreply.github.com>
